1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
A student sees a star shift.
What would convince them?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Perigee opens NASA SPHEREx images
by object name or sky position.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Play the observations. Check the dates,
wavelengths and unreliable pixels.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Then write an explanation and
keep the exact sources with it.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,000
The student has a conclusion to defend.
Their teacher can follow the evidence.
